# Reference transcripts built from your own recordings.
#
# Only references-sample.txt is tracked, and it is synthetic. Real transcripts are the
# content of radio communications not addressed to you; recording and republishing them is
# restricted in many countries (NL: Telecommunicatiewet art. 18.13, ITU RR 17.3), so they
# must not end up in the repository. Build your own with make_references.py.
references.txt
references-*.txt
!references-sample.txt

# bench.py / stress.py output (generated locally; captures are user data)
bench-results*.json
bench-report*.html
stress-*.json
captures/

# Secrets — never commit API keys
start-all.bat

